  "_doc": "Stream E (M2). A cult drummer who took the keep's chapel. Everything she does is to the BEAT: her drums (three war drums, use to smash) each power one attack pattern — while drum 1 stands she casts the shockwave rings, drum 2 the falling sparks, drum 3 the trance. Her Trance Rhythm is a long interruptible cast that puts the room to sleep. Smashing all three drums breaks her trance ward in phase 2. Enrage 5 min.",
